    {
      "source": "Value object to capture custom conversion. <a href=\"MongoCustomConversions.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.convert\"><code>MongoCustomConversions</code></a> also act as factory for\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/model/SimpleTypeHolder.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.model\"><code>SimpleTypeHolder</code></a>",
      "translation": "用于捕获自定义转换的 Value 对象。<a href=\"MongoCustomConversions.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.convert\"><code>MongoCustomConversions</code></a> 同时也充当 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/model/SimpleTypeHolder.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.model\"><code>SimpleTypeHolder</code></a> 的工厂。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Strategy to represent <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/math/BigDecimal.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.math\"><code>BigDecimal</code></a> and <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/math/BigInteger.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.math\"><code>BigInteger</code></a> values in MongoDB.",
      "translation": "在 MongoDB 中表示 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/math/BigDecimal.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.math\"><code>BigDecimal</code></a> 和 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/math/BigInteger.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.math\"><code>BigInteger</code></a> 值的策略。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"MongoCustomConversions.MongoConverterConfigurationAdapter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.convert\"><code>MongoCustomConversions.MongoConverterConfigurationAdapter</code></a> encapsulates creation of\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/convert/CustomConversions.ConverterConfiguration.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>CustomConversions.ConverterConfiguration</code></a> with MongoDB specifics.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"MongoCustomConversions.MongoConverterConfigurationAdapter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.convert\"><code>MongoCustomConversions.MongoConverterConfigurationAdapter</code></a> 封装了 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/convert/CustomConversions.ConverterConfiguration.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>CustomConversions.ConverterConfiguration</code></a> 的创建过程，并针对 MongoDB 进行了适配。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
